WEBVTT

00:11:29.356 --> 00:11:31.756
For the eight years I worked
in the White House,

00:11:31.796 --> 00:11:34.636
I got a daily report
from the intelligence community

00:11:34.676 --> 00:11:37.156
that collected from all parts
of the spectrum,

00:11:37.156 --> 00:11:39.676
and it was a much more accurate picture.

00:11:39.716 --> 00:11:40.876
Here's the analogy.

00:11:40.916 --> 00:11:45.036
The value spectrum is something
we too frequently look at

00:11:45.076 --> 00:11:49.076
through the very narrow aperture
of short-term profits

00:11:49.076 --> 00:11:52.036
for one stakeholder, the shareholders.

00:11:52.076 --> 00:11:55.116
But this leaves out
negative externalities,

00:11:55.116 --> 00:11:57.596
as the economists call them,
like the pollution.

00:11:57.596 --> 00:12:02.476
That's why we need a price on carbon
and a price on plastic pollution.